<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>畅行旅行 - 发现中国美好旅程</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #0056b3;
            --secondary-color: #ff6600;
            --text-dark: #333333;
            --text-light: #666666;
            --bg-light: #f4f7f6;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --border-color: #dddddd;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            background-color: var(--white);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo span {
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0056b3 0%, #003d80 100%);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 4rem 1rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Search Box */
        .search-box {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .input-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            text-align: left;
            flex: 1 1 150px;
        }

        .input-group label {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .input-group input, .input-group select {
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .search-btn {
            background-color: var(--secondary-color);
            color: var(--white);
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            align-self: flex-end;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .search-btn:hover {
            background-color: #e55c00;
        }

        /* Destinations */
        .destinations {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--white);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            display: block;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card-img-placeholder {
            height: 160px;
            background-color: #ddd;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .card-body {
            padding: 1rem;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .card-text {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #222;
            color: #aaa;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }

        footer p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
            .search-box { flex-direction: column; }
            .input-group { width: 100%; }
            .search-btn { width: 100%; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="index.html" class="logo">
                <span>畅行</span> 旅行
            </a>
            <nav>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="index.html">首页</a></li>
                    <li><a href="results.html">热门目的地</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">我的订单</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>开启您的中国之旅</h1>
        <p>搜索全国各地的优质酒店与行程，即刻出发</p>

        <form class="search-box" action="results.html" method="get">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="destination">目的地</label>
                <input type="text" id="destination" name="q" placeholder="城市或景点" required>
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="checkin">入住日期</label>
                <input type="date" id="checkin" name="checkin" required>
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="checkout">退房日期</label>
                <input type="date" id="checkout" name="checkout" required>
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
                <label for="guests">住客人数</label>
                <select id="guests" name="guests">
                    <option value="1">1 人</option>
                    <option value="2" selected>2 人</option>
                    <option value="3">3 人</option>
                    <option value="4">4 人及以上</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="search-btn">搜索酒店</button>
        </form>
    </section>

    <section class="destinations">
        <h2 class="section-title">热门精选</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <a href="results.html" class="card">
                <div class="card-img-placeholder" style="background: #e3f2fd;">杭州西湖风光</div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">杭州</h3>
                    <p class="card-text">湖畔漫步，品味龙井茶韵</p>
                </div>
            </a>
            <a href="results.html" class="card">
                <div class="card-img-placeholder" style="background: #fff3e0;">上海外滩夜景</div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">上海</h3>
                    <p class="card-text">魔都繁华，现代都市体验</p>
                </div>
            </a>
            <a href="results.html" class="card">
                <div class="card-img-placeholder" style="background: #e8f5e9;">北京故宫雪景</div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">北京</h3>
                    <p class="card-text">古都历史，探索皇家文化</p>
                </div>
            </a>
            <a href="results.html" class="card">
                <div class="card-img-placeholder" style="background: #fce4ec;">成都美食与熊猫</div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">成都</h3>
                    <p class="card-text">巴适生活，火锅与熊猫</p>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="destinations">
        <h2 class="section-title">为什么选择畅行</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card" style="cursor: default; transform: none;">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">价格透明</h3>
                    <p class="card-text">无隐形消费，所有费用清晰列明。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card" style="cursor: default; transform: none;">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">24 小时客服</h3>
                    <p class="card-text">旅途中遇到问题，随时联系我们的专业团队。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card" style="cursor: default; transform: none;">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="card-title">免费取消</h3>
                    <p class="card-text">特定房型支持入住前 24 小时免费取消。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2023 畅行旅行。保留所有权利。 | 关于我们 | 隐私政策</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // Set default dates to tomorrow and day after tomorrow
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            const today = new Date();
            const tomorrow = new Date(today);
            tomorrow.setDate(tomorrow.getDate() + 1);
            const dayAfter = new Date(today);
            dayAfter.setDate(dayAfter.getDate() + 2);

            const dateInput = (date) => date.toISOString().split('T')[0];

            const checkin = document.getElementById('checkin');
            const checkout = document.getElementById('checkout');

            if(checkin) checkin.value = dateInput(tomorrow);
            if(checkout) checkout.value = dateInput(dayAfter);
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
